Subject: [PATCH 7/9] tui: share alternate-screen setup

Centralize crossterm raw-mode and alternate-screen setup for ratatui
commands. Restore the terminal through a cleanup guard on success,
cancellation, and errors, and move arrange onto the shared runner.
